  "id": "vmi",
  "term": "VMI",
  "definition": "VMI stands for visual motor integration, a fine motor skill that combines visual-spatial input and attention with precise hand movements. It is used in tasks such as writing, drawing, cutting, and folding and involves stronger hand-eye coordination than fine motor coordination alone.",
